er}$\n\n- $Q:\\pi \\text{ is a negative number}$" :question/worked-solution "The given sentence is the negation of the following sentence: \n\n$\\pi $ is a rational or negative number, \n\nwhich can be expressed symbolically as $P∨Q.$\n\nThe negation is represented by the symbol \"$¬$\".  \n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as $¬(P∨Q).$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186410109 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152053 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c49d316-3552-5ace-a749-5070b64230c3" :knowledge-point/title "Completing a Truth Table for a Compound Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4633fe49-2c21-5720-a63c-558f45288fa2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410068} {:answer/id #uuid "4a01d36c-4604-5b36-b3e3-00487d979e7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410070}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4633fe49-2c21-5720-a63c-558f45288fa2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410068} :answer-field/id #uuid "5660f069-31c9-5611-ada9-3b00eeb9abf2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410097} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b14e0483-a372-5fd9-9aac-a4c6418f0a40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410084} {:answer/id #uuid "e24ff342-e818-59d7-8686-5fbf7bfd82cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410091}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e24ff342-e818-59d7-8686-5fbf7bfd82cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type